            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great holiday recipe for get togethers. I found that it is even better if you substitute hot cider for the water. Sprinkle with a little nutmeg and insert a cinnamin stick.",
